contentText:
Lorde is feeling ready for change after her contract with Universal Music Group expired last year, the pop star announced Wednesday (March 18).

In a voice note sent to fans ahead of her run of Ultrasound festival shows, Lorde revealed that after about 17 years, she&#8217;s no longer with her first label home.

